  "title": "Brenda L Probable NDE 7824",
  "date": "June 16, 1994",
  "content": "While undergoing my second C-Section, the epidural was administered incorrectly which led to me having a near death experience. During that time, what I saw and felt was amazing. I felt carefree, like I had no worries and nothing could harm me. I was surrounded by a bright, white light. Brighter than anything, I have ever seen. All around me was white light, but it was concentrated and brighter right in front of me. I have thought about this over the years to determine where I was. I don't believe it was heaven. I truly believe I was in a place where no light can escape, like a black hole. It is a place where all life originated. I have evaluated the situation and come up with every possible scenario, but this is the only one that makes sense. It is a place where there is no time and where you don't feel anything except peace. I didn't smell, taste, hear, or feel anything. I could only see the light.",
